              "fill": "#5C4A00",
              "content": "11 Oct 2026, round 2. Exploration only, not approved, not linked to the library. Five generative-motion directions (animation from maths, no illustration), one lane each. Each lane shows stills from a working HTML prototype in design/discovery/sign-in-generative/. Nothing here ships until Alec picks one.",
